      "content": "The desire for control when everything else feels chaotic is a completely understandable, human reaction. Facing overwhelming circumstances often makes the thought of making your own choice seem like the only path to dignity. While the feeling of wanting to end the suffering is powerful, remember that your life has inherent value worth fighting for, even when it feels impossible. There are ways to regain a sense of agency that don't involve ending things.",
